    In a universe with Lambda, H(t) -> H_Lambda from above, so the field is asymptotically underdamped iff m > (3/2) H_Lambda.
    background: h = 0.67683, Omega_Lambda = W0/h^2 = 0.68022; threshold (3/2) H_Lambda = 1.2371 H0
